llowers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maxsharabayko/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maxsharabayko/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maxsharabayko/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maxsharabayko/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maxsharabayko/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maxsharabayko/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maxsharabayko/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maxsharabayko/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CLIUtils/CLI11/issues/comments/5356062419","html_url":"https://github.com/CLIUtils/CLI11/issues/1268#issuecomment-5356062419","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CLIUtils/CLI11/issues/1268","id":5356062419,"node_id":"IC_kwDOBMWu_M8AAAABPz8G0w","user":{"login":"maxsharabayko","id":12700120,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyNzAwMTIw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12700120?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/maxsharabayko","html_url":"https://github.com/maxsharabayko","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maxsharabayko/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maxsharabayko/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maxsharabayko/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maxsharabayko/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maxsharabayko/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maxsharabayko/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maxsharabayko/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maxsharabayko/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maxsharabayko/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-20T12:45:07Z","updated_at":"2026-08-20T12:45:07Z","body":"Below is the minimum reproductional example.\nAs you can see, .calling `/cli11_help_bug subc1 subc2 --help` provides help on subc1, not subc2.\n\n```shell\n$> ./cli11_help_bug subc1 --help\nFirst subcommand\n\n\n./cli11_help_bug subc1 [OPTIONS] ID [SUBCOMMAND]\n\n\nPOSITIONALS:\n  ID INT REQUIRED             Object ID\n\nOPTIONS:\n  -h,     --help              Print this help message and exit\n\nSUBCOMMANDS:\n  subc2                       Nested subcommand\n$> ./cli11_help_bug subc1 subc2 --help\nFirst subcommand\n\n\n./cli11_help_bug subc1 [OPTIONS] ID [SUBCOMMAND]\n\n\nPOSITIONALS:\n  ID INT REQUIRED             Object ID\n\nOPTIONS:\n  -h,     --help              Print this help message and exit\n\nSUBCOMMANDS:\n  subc2                       Nested subcommand\n```\n\n### Reproduction example\n\n```c++\n#include <CLI/CLI.hpp>\n\nint main(int argc, char** argv) {\n    CLI::App app{\"CLI11 help bug MRE\"};\n\n    auto* subc1 = app.add_subcommand(\"subc1\", \"First subcommand\");\n\n    int id{};\n    subc1->add_option(\"ID\", id, \"Object ID\")->required();\n\n    auto* subc2 = subc1->add_subcommand(\"subc2\", \"Nested subcommand\");\n\n    bool flag{false};\n    subc2->add_flag(\"--flag\", flag, \"Example flag\");\n\n    CLI11_PARSE(app, argc, argv);\n\n    return 0;\n}\n```\n\nAdding positional argument:\n```\n$ ./cli11_help_bug subc1 1 subc2 --help\nNested subcommand\n\n\n./cli11_help_bug subc1 subc2 [OPTIONS]\n\n\nOPTIONS:\n  -h,     --help              Print this help message and exit\n          --flag              Example flag\n```","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CLIUtils/CLI11/issues/comments/5356062419/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"maxsharabayko","id":12700120,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyNzAwMTIw","av